      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REDEEMER'S WAY (4) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 16.58. Has a tricky draw to overcome but goes well at this distance. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Flying at the moment and expecting another big run. NINA SIYAN (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.3 lengths from the winner REDEEMER'S WAY (16.67) at this track. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from five starts. Can feature again. PARTY ANYTIME (8) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (16.87) behind NOAKI SEA BREEZE at this track. Will give a great sight again. NOAKI SEA BREEZE (1) scored last time and can measure up again.",
